      "id": "msg_1187_C10R0108_00023",
      "en_US": [
        "The three clowns will each ask you\n",
        "a skill-testing question.\r",
        "The questions will all have to do\n",
        "with Pokémon.\r",
        "After all, a Pokétch is a tool for\n",
        "Pokémon Trainers.\r",
        "Collect a Coupon from each clown,\n",
        "then come see me, OK?"
      ]
    },
